{"3506280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spherical Symphony", "steam_appid": 3506280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/8a57d6f925abe6c7cf492e1e5b375029.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/8a57d6f925abe6c7cf492e1e5b375029.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/8a57d6f925abe6c7cf492e1e5b375029.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Spherical Symphony</strong>, you’re a gentle steward of tiny, living worlds. <strong>Guide planets back into harmony</strong>, attract curious space-sea creatures, lead cozy cat-folk, and defend against mysterious Voidlings. Each planet you stabilize brings the star one heartbeat closer to waking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stabilize Tiny Planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/25a2d2edbdca5f6b5af0a6daa6d2372e.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/25a2d2edbdca5f6b5af0a6daa6d2372e.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/25a2d2edbdca5f6b5af0a6daa6d2372e.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance <strong>Atmosphere</strong>, <strong>Biosphere</strong>, and <strong>Hydrosphere</strong> (and sometimes water levels) while managing resources unique to each world. <strong>Watch visual changes — clouds, greenery, and gentle weather — mirror your progress.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living Bestiary of Stars &amp; Seas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/70f12a954029b0c34a9ca11e88ff8f5f.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/70f12a954029b0c34a9ca11e88ff8f5f.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/70f12a954029b0c34a9ca11e88ff8f5f.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract whimsical <strong>Tidelings </strong>— space whales, jellyfish, stingrays, and more — each with a role in your world’s ecosystem. <strong>Feed and care for them</strong> to keep them close… or watch them drift away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lunapaws at Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/98a2d418e2cacdd796fff06c304e609e.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/98a2d418e2cacdd796fff06c304e609e.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/98a2d418e2cacdd796fff06c304e609e.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit cozy, cat-like <strong>Lunapaws</strong> as <strong>Herbalists</strong>, <strong>Fisherfolk</strong>, <strong>Farmers</strong>, and <strong>Tinkerers</strong> to automate chores, gather resources, and keep your planets humming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trade Across the Void</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/83fd55d31bfd2f5490df7d5c31a76008.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/83fd55d31bfd2f5490df7d5c31a76008.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/83fd55d31bfd2f5490df7d5c31a76008.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bridge planets</strong> to route materials where they’re needed most. Nudge a struggling world back to balance with smart interplanetary logistics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend the Light</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/6372f7395c11b31f2ac7b04a9e940391.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/6372f7395c11b31f2ac7b04a9e940391.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/6372f7395c11b31f2ac7b04a9e940391.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>defenses</strong> and plan <strong>strategies</strong> to repel creeping <strong>Voidlings</strong> that slip through portals and nibble at your hard-won harmony.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/8a57d6f925abe6c7cf492e1e5b375029.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/8a57d6f925abe6c7cf492e1e5b375029.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/8a57d6f925abe6c7cf492e1e5b375029.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Spherical Symphony</strong>, you’re a gentle steward of tiny, living worlds. <strong>Guide planets back into harmony</strong>, attract curious space-sea creatures, lead cozy cat-folk, and defend against mysterious Voidlings. Each planet you stabilize brings the star one heartbeat closer to waking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stabilize Tiny Planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/25a2d2edbdca5f6b5af0a6daa6d2372e.poster.avif?t=1763158314\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/25a2d2edbdca5f6b5af0a6daa6d2372e.webm?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506280/extras/25a2d2edbdca5f6b5af0a6daa6d2372e.mp4?t=1763158314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance <strong>Atmosphere</strong>, <strong>Biosphere</strong>, and <strong>Hydrosphere</strong> (and sometimes water levels) while managing resources unique to each world. <strong>Watch visual changes — clouds, greenery, and gentle weather — mirror your progress.</strong></p><h2 cl